            "text": "```json\n{\n  \"findings\": [\n    {\n      \"clauseType\": \"Anti-Assignment\",\n      \"characterization\": \"QUALIFIED\",\n      \"quote\": \"All rights (under any applicable intellectual property right) granted herein are not sublicenseable, transferable or assignable.\",\n      \"overrideQuote\": \"Notwithstanding the foregoing, either party may use a third party web host, but all actions or failures to act of the web host that would be a breach of this Agreement, were the actions or failures to act taken by the applicable party, shall be deemed a breach of this Agreement.  In addition, 2TheMart may grant sublicenses to companies that 2TheMart has a business relationship with to the extent that 2TheMart Content is visible from such company's web-site through a link or other means.\",\n      \"note\": \"Section 6.5 restricts transfer and assignment of granted rights, but carves out exceptions permitting third-party web hosting, certain sublicenses by 2TheMart, and transfers to successors via corporate reorganization under Section 12.3.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"clauseType\": \"Change Of Control\",\n      \"characterization\": \"QUALIFIED\",\n      \"quote\": \"If a majority of the equity securities of either 2TheMart or i-Escrow, Inc. (except that i-Escrow may sell all or a majority of its equity securities or voting interests to i-Escrow.com, and i-Escrow.com may sell all or a majority of its equity securities or voting interests to i-Escrow's existing shareholders, without triggering the foregoing) are acquired by another company during the term of this Agreement either company may terminate this Agreement, without liability, by giving a thirty (30) days written notice to the other party.\",\n      \"overrideQuote\": \"except that i-Escrow may sell all or a majority of its equity securities or voting interests to i-Escrow.com, and i-Escrow.com may sell all or a majority of its equity securities or voting interests to i-Escrow's existing shareholders, without triggering the foregoing\",\n      \"note\": \"Section 8.3 permits termination upon a majority acquisition of equity securities by another company, but expressly exempts certain internal restructuring transfers involving i-Escrow and i-Escrow.com.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"clauseType\": \"Exclusivity\",\n      \"characterization\": \"NOT_FOUND\",\n      \"quote\": null,\n      \"overrideQuote\": null,\n      \"note\": \"The contract does not contain an exclusivity clause; granted licenses are explicitly non-exclusive.\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n```",
